# Biorganic Carapace: "When this Equipment enters, attach it to target creature you control", "Equipped creature gets +2/+2 and has
# 'Whenever this creature deals combat damage to a player, draw a card for each modified creature you control'" (CR 700.9, 613.1f).
# Bot1 casts it on turn 1 and attaches it to the Ornithopter (0/2 becomes 2/4); on turn 3 it casts Honor, putting a +1/+1 counter on
# its Memnite. Bot2's Runeclaw Bear, with a counter from its own Honor, is modified too but is not Bot1's. The Ornithopter attacks
# and deals 2 combat damage: it draws two cards for the equipped Ornithopter and the Memnite, not three (the Bear is Bot2's), and
# Honor drew one: three in hand.

